  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "和 CUTLASS 的 grouped GEMM 差在哪",
      "items": [
        "CUTLASS 传统 grouped GEMM 可 group 任意维",
        "DeepGEMM 只 group M:N、K 必须固定",
        "理由:各 expert 的 hidden/inter 形状本来就一样"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "为什么解码非得 masked",
      "items": [
        "开 CUDA graph 后 CPU 不知道各 expert 收到多少 token",
        "mask 张量让 kernel 只算有效段",
        "典型输入正是 DeepEP 的低延迟 dispatch 输出"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "反向是另一个变体",
      "items": [
        "权重反向:k_grouped_fp8_gemm_tn_contiguous",
        "此时 M、N 固定,K 才是被分组的轴",
        "记住:正向 group M、反向 group K"
      ]
    }
  ]
}